docs/architecture/studio-execution.md:7:This document defines component ownership and technical contracts. [PRD §5.2](../../PRD.md#52-ui-testing-feature-checks-studio) and the [BRD](../brd/checks-ui-studio.brd.md) define product scope and GA criteria; [Epic 10](../epics/EPIC-10-EXECUTION.yaml) and its stories contain implementation order and acceptance tests. The [review](studio-execution-review.md) and [SSE assessment](studio-sse-viability.md) retain decision rationale.
